---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2025-01-01';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Arctus MC"
  description="Arctus MC's privacy policy covering data collection, cookies, advertising, and your rights."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="container-content py-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-frost-100 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-frost-500 mb-10">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-frost-200 mb-3">Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed">
        Arctus MC (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;our&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;) is committed to
        protecting your privacy. This policy describes how we collect, use, and share information
        when you visit this website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-frost-200 mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        We do not require registration or collect personal information directly. Our web server
        may automatically log standard technical data such as your IP address, browser type,
        referring URL, and pages visited. This data is used solely for operating and improving
        the site.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-frost-200 mb-3">Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Arctus MC uses cookies and similar tracking technologies. These may be set by us or by
        third-party partners (such as advertising networks) and may be used to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-frost-400 space-y-2 pl-2 mb-4">
        <li>Remember your preferences.</li>
        <li>Measure site traffic and usage patterns (analytics).</li>
        <li>Deliver and measure the effectiveness of advertisements.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed">
        You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences. Note that disabling
        cookies may affect site functionality.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-frost-200 mb-3">Advertising</h2>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Arctus MC displays advertisements served by Google AdSense and potentially other ad
        networks. These third-party vendors may use cookies and web beacons to serve ads based
        on your prior visits to this site and other sites on the internet.
      </p>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on
        your visit to our site and/or other sites on the internet. You may opt out of
        personalized advertising by visiting{' '}
        <a
          href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-brand-300 hover:text-brand-200 transition-colors duration-150"
        >
          Google Ads Settings
        </a>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed">
        For more information on how Google uses data from sites that use its services, please
        visit{' '}
        <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-brand-300 hover:text-brand-200 transition-colors duration-150"
        >
          How Google uses data when you use our partners&rsquo; sites or apps
        </a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-frost-200 mb-3">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed">
        Arctus MC may use analytics and other third-party tools that collect anonymized usage
        data. These services have their own privacy policies governing how they handle your
        data. We do not sell or rent personal information to third parties.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-frost-200 mb-3">Minecraft Skin Data</h2>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed">
        Skin textures and usernames displayed on Arctus MC are sourced from the publicly
        accessible Mojang API. We store the associated username and UUID for attribution
        purposes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-frost-200 mb-3">Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed">
        Depending on your location, you may have rights regarding your personal data, including
        the right to access, correct, or delete information.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-frost-200 mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-frost-400 leading-relaxed">
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected by an
        updated &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
